cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this Lean formalization, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "LeanC2: Lean 4 formalization of the C2 analytic framework"
type: software
version: "zenodo-2026-05-07"
date-released: "2026-05-07"
repository-code: "https://github.com/thiagomassensini/c2_lean"
url: "https://github.com/thiagomassensini/c2_lean"
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 and Mathlib 4 formalization of the C2 analytic number theory framework.
  Covers operator algebra (branch, genuine, cutoff), meromorphic continuation
  and identity layers, near-axis transversality and Taylor radius, bulk and edge
  nonvanishing certificates, glue decomposition geometry, finite height coverage,
  and the analytic transfer chain to the zeta function.
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - Mathlib
  - formal mathematics
  - Riemann zeta function
  - C2 framework
